//RS // D-DX-STORE1=A / #2476: typed Store over the canonical reactive signal.
//RS //
//RS // Store state has one JetSignal<T> reactive/read path; JetShared is the
//RS // owner-bound opaque revision ticket for optimistic operations. Transactions
//RS // publish one signal write and append one bounded, monotonic history entry.
//RS // Scrubbing reads a historical snapshot; it never changes the live signal.
//RS //
//RS // The event stream is host-neutral metadata. A renderer or devtools adapter can
//RS // marshal it into the canonical Store event without reimplementing store
//RS // semantics. History and events are retained in development, and in the
//RS // explicitly inspected read-only release profile only.
//RS 
